@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071
@token = replace-with-login-token

### Weekly report of the teams I follow
# Only the dates are sent: the backend derives the leagues and teams from the
# team_subscriptions rows of the caller.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/weekly-report?startDate=2026-11-02&endDate=2026-11-09
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/weekly-report?startDate=2026-11-09&endDate=2026-11-02
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}